      &lt;td style='width: 184px; height: 90px; font-weight: bold;' align='undefined' valign='undefined'&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td colspan='3' rowspan='1' style='height: 90px; width: 291px;' align='undefined' valign='undefined'&gt;Floods in Bangkok have forced trains bound for Surat Thani, a popular jumpoff point for tourists heading to Phuket, to start from the Nakhon Pathom railway station, on the west of the Thai capital.The Southern Line services were shut down at Bangkoks central Hua Lampong train station yesterday as flood waters crossed the tracks used by southbound trains.&amp;nbsp;
